{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22114","headline":"赠吴丹 · 白居易","name":"赠吴丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巧者力苦劳，智者心苦忧。\n爱君无巧智，终岁闲悠悠。\n尝登御史府，亦佐东诸候。\n手操纠谬简，心运决胜筹。\n宦途似风水，君心如虚舟。\n泛然而不有，进退得自由。\n今来脱豸冠，时往侍龙楼。\n官曹称心静，居处随迹幽。\n冬负南荣日，支体甚温柔。\n夏卧北窗风，枕席如凉秋。\n南山入舍下，酒瓮在牀头。\n人间有闲地，何必隐林丘。\n顾我愚且昧，劳生殊未休。\n一入金门直，星霜三四周。\n主恩信难报，近地徒久留。\n终当乞闲官，退与夫子游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}